Copied from this release:
- src/fax.rs
- src/fax_paper.rs
- src/oscillator.rs
- GrayImage and pixel_count from src/image.rs
- PaperBoundaryKind from src/paper.rs
- WORK_SAMPLE_RATE, LinearResampler and FrequencyDemodulator from src/decoder.rs

Local integration changes:
- Adjusted crate-relative imports for this vendor module.
- Replaced thiserror derives/attributes with handwritten Display and std::error::Error.
- Retained only error and image primitives needed by radiofax; no SSTV code is vendored.
- Limited FaxEncoder, FaxEncodeOptions, encode_fax and Oscillator to cfg(test).
- Moved upstream fax.rs, fax_streaming.rs and fax_paper.rs tests into local unit-test modules and adjusted imports; replaced the static_assertions helper with a local generic assertion.
- FrequencyDemodulator rejects low vectors relative to the recent input envelope instead of a fixed 0.0005 full-scale threshold. This preserves FM phase differences at weak SDR input levels without applying gain to signal or noise.
- `FaxDecoder::advance_erasure` and `FaxPaperDecoder::advance_erasure` advance the
  existing resampler and raster deadlines through receiver-declared RF fades without
  demodulation, APT/phasing or image-timing learning. Intersecting rows are explicitly
  marked `Erased`; the adapter paints their final corrected output neutral Gray8=128.

No third-party dependencies are required.
